       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BUILD-DEMO.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 WS-PROCESSING-STATUS PIC X(10) VALUE "STARTED".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       MAIN-PROCESS.
           PERFORM INITIALIZE-PROCESS
           PERFORM PROCESS-DATA
           PERFORM FINALIZE-PROCESS
           STOP RUN.

       INITIALIZE-PROCESS.
           DISPLAY "========================================"
           DISPLAY "       BUILD AND RUN DEMONSTRATION"
           DISPLAY "========================================"
           DISPLAY "PROCESS STATUS: " WS-PROCESSING-STATUS.

       PROCESS-DATA.
           MOVE "RUNNING" TO WS-PROCESSING-STATUS
           DISPLAY "PROCESS STATUS: " WS-PROCESSING-STATUS
           DISPLAY "COBOL PROGRAM IS EXECUTING."
           DISPLAY "BUILD PROCESS COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY".

       FINALIZE-PROCESS.
           MOVE "COMPLETED" TO WS-PROCESSING-STATUS
           DISPLAY "PROCESS STATUS: " WS-PROCESSING-STATUS
           DISPLAY "========================================".
